; Hollow a filleted box: the shell's inner surface is the fillet's
; blends offset inward. Sampling those offsets at a fixed surface
; parameter instead of at the vertex used to scatter the cavity.
[let body [shell 2.0 [fillet 12.0 [cube 100.0 100.0 100.0]]]]
#[body [shell 2.0 [cube 100.0 100.0 100.0]]]
